<title>SIERRA LEONE: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOVERNMENT LIST (970804)</p>
<p> *************************************************************</p>
<p> * 26 May 97 - Army Major Johnny Paul Koroma declared	  *</p>
<p> *		 himself head of state but his junta fails to  *</p>
<p> *		 win international recognition		     *</p>
<p> * 25 May 97 - Soldiers in Sierra Leone ousted the civilian  *</p>
<p> *		 government and President Ahmad Tejan Kabbah.  *</p>
<p> *************************************************************</p>
